BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Learning and Development Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Policy code: POL-HR-035. Owner: People Team \(Learning and Development\). Effective date: 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (October 2024. Applies to: all permanent and fixed-term employees at Leeds, Rotterdam, Austin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 675 Td (and Penang.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 650 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (Meridian Instruments builds precision sensing equipment, and the quality of our Halcyon,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (Tessera and Lumen products depends on the skills of the people who design, build, sell and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (support them. This policy explains how employees can access funded training, how requests are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 589 Td (approved, how study leave works and when course fees must be repaid if an employee leaves) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 576 Td (shortly after completing funded study.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 551 Td (2. Principles) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 529 Td (- Development is a shared responsibility. Employees are expected to identify their own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 516 Td (   development needs and discuss them with their line manager at least twice a year, normally) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 503 Td (   alongside the mid-year and year-end performance conversations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 490 Td (- Training should link to the employee's current role, a planned next role, or a capability) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 477 Td (   the business needs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 464 Td (- We prefer the most cost-effective route that meets the need: internal courses, mentoring) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451 Td (   and on-the-job learning are considered before external spend.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 438 Td (- Mandatory compliance training \(for example the Code of Conduct and Data Protection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 425 Td (   modules\) is funded centrally and does not count against individual budgets.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 409 Td (3. Individual training budget) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 387 Td (Every employee has an indicative individual training budget each fiscal year \(1 April to 31) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 374 Td (March\). The budget is held in the employee's home cost centre and is not transferable between) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 361 Td (years.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 340 Td (Site | Currency | Annual individual budget) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 328 Td (Leeds \(UK\) | GBP | \2431,200) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 316 Td (Rotterdam \(NL\) | EUR | \2001,400) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 304 Td (Austin \(US\) | USD | $1,500) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 292 Td (Penang \(MY\) | MYR | RM 4,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 270 Td (The budget covers course fees, examination fees, conference registration and learning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 257 Td (materials. Travel and accommodation for training are claimed under the Travel and Expense) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 244 Td (Policy \(POL-FIN-007\) and are charged to the same cost centre, but do not count against the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 231 Td (individual budget.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 209 Td (Unused budget does not carry over and cannot be paid out.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 184 Td (4. Requesting training) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 162 Td (All external training must be requested in advance using form F-260 Training Request, submitted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 149 Td (in Keel at Keel > Learning > Training Request. Requests should be raised at least four weeks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 136 Td (before the booking deadline for the course.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 114 Td (A complete request includes:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 92 Td (- the course or qualification title and provider;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 79 Td (- dates, format \(in person, virtual or blended\) and location;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 66 Td (- the total cost, including any examination fees;) Tj ET
endstream
