BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (- how the training relates to the employee's role or development plan;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (- whether the employee is asking for study leave.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 700 Td (5. Approval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 678 Td (Approval depends on the cost of the request compared with the individual budget.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 657 Td (Request value | Approver) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 645 Td (Within the individual budget | Line manager) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 633 Td (Above the individual budget | Head of Department plus L&D) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 611 Td (Requests above the individual budget are routed automatically in Keel to the Head of Department) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 598 Td (and then to the Learning and Development team, who can be contacted at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 585 Td (learning@meridian-instruments.example. L&D checks whether a group programme or internal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 572 Td (alternative already exists and may negotiate with the provider.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 550 Td (Once approved, courses are booked by L&D or paid through the normal purchasing route. Employees) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 537 Td (should not pay course fees personally and claim them back unless L&D has agreed this in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 524 Td (writing.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 499 Td (6. Professional qualifications) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 477 Td (Meridian supports multi-year professional qualifications that are relevant to the role, such as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 464 Td (chartered engineering, accountancy, HR and procurement qualifications. These are approved on a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451 Td (module-by-module or year-by-year basis, and each year's cost is assessed against the approval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 438 Td (thresholds in section 5.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 416 Td (Where Meridian pays for a professional qualification, the employee must sign form F-265 Study) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 403 Td (Support and Fee Repayment Agreement before the first payment is made. L&D sends F-265 through) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 390 Td (Keel once the F-260 request has been approved.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 365 Td (7. Study leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 343 Td (Employees studying for an approved professional qualification are entitled to:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 321 Td (- up to 5 days of paid study leave per year; and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 308 Td (- paid leave for the day of each examination sitting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 295 Td (Study leave is requested in Keel at Keel > Time Off > Request Leave using the leave type "Study) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 282 Td (Leave", and should be booked at least two weeks in advance. Study leave that is not used in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 269 Td (fiscal year lapses. Resits are supported once; further resits are at the employee's own cost) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 256 Td (unless the Head of Department agrees otherwise.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 231 Td (8. Repayment of fees) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 209 Td (Under the F-265 agreement, if the employee resigns or is dismissed for misconduct after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 196 Td (Meridian has funded a qualification or a single course costing more than the individual budget,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 183 Td (the employee repays a proportion of the fees:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 162 Td (Leaving date | Repayment) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 150 Td (Within 12 months of completion | 100% of fees) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 138 Td (Within 24 months of completion | 50% of fees) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 126 Td (After 24 months | Nothing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 104 Td (Repayment is deducted from final pay where local law allows, or invoiced otherwise. Repayment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 91 Td (is not required where the employee is made redundant or leaves because of ill health.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 78 Td (Completion means the date of the final examination or the course end date, whichever is later.) Tj ET
endstream
