BT /F2 13 Tf 54 726 Td (9. Conferences and events) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 704 Td (Attendance at external conferences is treated as training and requires an F-260 request. Where) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 691 Td (an employee is presenting on behalf of Meridian, the presentation must be reviewed in advance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 678 Td (by the relevant product line leader, and any material about Tessera or Lumen roadmaps must be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 665 Td (cleared by the CTO's office.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 640 Td (10. Records) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 618 Td (Keel records all approved training, completion dates and certificates. Employees should upload) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 605 Td (certificates at Keel > Learning > My Learning within 30 days of completion so that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 592 Td (qualifications appear on their profile.) Tj ET
