BT /F1 10 Tf 54 545 Td (- Travel and Expense Policy \(POL-FIN-007\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 532 Td (- Employee Handbook \(HBK-HR-001\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 519 Td (- Cost Centre Directory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 506 Td (Questions about this policy should be sent to learning@meridian-instruments.example.) Tj ET
